{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000010760","bookName":"Venganza tras el silencio: El ingeniero invencible (Doblado)","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000010760/42000010760.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":10590211,"followCount":231906,"introduction":"Sebastián Montero, ingeniero de primer nivel, regresa a casa tras diez años en zonas rurales remotas. En el trayecto, se choca con Isabella Castillo, hermana del prometido de su hermana mayor, y descubre que los Castillo planean apropiarse del patrimonio de los Montero. Sebastián decide ocultar su identidad y actuar en silencio. Cuando finalmente revela quién es y presenta pruebas irrefutables de sus crímenes, los Castillo son llevados ante la justicia.","chapterCount":55,"labels":["Justice Served","Modern"],"tags":["Justice Served","Modern"],"typeTwoIds":[309],"typeTwoNames":["Contraataque"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":309,"name":"Contraataque","replaceName":"contraataque"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Contraataque","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Venganza-tras-el-silencio-El-ingeniero-invencible-Doblado","bookNameLower":"venganza-tras-el-silencio-el-ingeniero-invencible-doblado","shelfTime":"2026-05-04 12:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-05-04 12:00:00","performerList":[{"performerId":"25139","performerName":"Ping Qin","performerFormatName":"Ping-Qin","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/9x3/25139/25139.jpg?time=1785925526190","videoCount":2},{"performerId":"24991","performerName":"Ziming Wu","performerFormatName":"Ziming-Wu","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/1x9/24991/24991.jpg?time=1785135978117","videoCount":2}],"performerIdList":[24991,25139]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700689793","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/39/0x6/06x7/067x0/06701000024/700689793_1/700689793.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=yG~71SezKjX3l3jy9GCgmZqBTYBvwNg8gutdb1iYCTRadEctHzfMUDxsxbmAfQFhX3zHTi3d0k6iQi